### REGISTER USER
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### LOGIN (use the same email you registered)
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
